{"source":"8f483bc1de854f7783495ffe96ef1ea8","folderId":"810e4252011244c18d6317379b4bb3a7","values":{"webmap":"d8b383b0c9b8413daeff1a34bfce0422","type":"webmap","fullAppSettings":true,"header":true,"introductionContent":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>My Elected Representative can be used by citizens to determine who represents them in local, state, and federal elected offices. This application can be accessed from a smartphone, tablet, and desktop computer.</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box; font-variant-caps:normal; font-variant-ligatures:normal; text-align:start; text-decoration-color:initial; text-decoration-style:initial; word-spacing:0px;\"><span style=\"color:black;\"><span>Search for an address in the search bar or click a location directly on the map to define an area of interest.&nbsp;Click an elected office in the list of results to view elected representative information. Make sure you clear the selection (top middle button) to search a different address.</span></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black;\"><span>For more information on Voter Status please visit the </span></span><a href=\"https://mvp.sos.ga.gov/s/\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:black;\"><span><strong>Georgia MY VOTER page.</strong></span></span></a></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"color:black;\"><span>You can also check your polling location </span></span><a href=\"https://dekalbgis.maps.arcgis.com/apps/instant/lookup/index.html?appid=3d306f8fddd84509aaa4e735f3168df8\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:black;\"><span><strong>HERE</strong></span></span></a><span style=\"color:black;\"><span> and see early voting locations </span></span><a href=\"https://dcgis.dekalbcountyga.gov/earlyvoting\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:black;\"><span><strong>HERE</strong></span></span></a><span style=\"color:black;\"><span>.</span></span></p>","zoneLookupLayers":{"layers":[{"id":"1819597ffff-layer-15","fields":[],"fieldOrder":[]},{